{"id":"n91676-1-8","stage":5,"title":"지구력 · 持久力","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91676-1-8-1","ko":"저 선수는 훈련을 오래 버티지 못해요.","zh":"那位选手无法长时间坚持训练。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71215","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"선수는","meaning":"选手，运动员","explanation":"선수：选手，运动员；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"선수","audio":"/audio/c4df0bdce9d53b7cc97a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62050","senseId":"1","lemma":"선수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선수는","audio":"/audio/310068a7016fb2b50f47.mp3"}},{"text":"훈련을","meaning":"训练","explanation":"훈련：训练；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"훈련","audio":"/audio/99639e469007f57866a7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"87055","senseId":"1","lemma":"훈련","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"훈련을","audio":"/audio/9e4807dd1e41f6467246.mp3"}},{"text":"오래","meaning":"好久，很久","explanation":"오래：好久，很久。","readings":[{"term":"오래","audio":"/audio/2f64811b687303a9be76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57308","senseId":"1","lemma":"오래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오래","audio":"/audio/2f64811b687303a9be76.mp3"}},{"text":"버티지","meaning":"坚持，挺住","explanation":"버티다：坚持，挺住；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"버티다","audio":"/audio/2944aeb3d3cc8afc54b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14497","senseId":"1","lemma":"버티다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버티지","audio":"/audio/8a41425869d6053396de.mp3"}},{"text":"못해요.","meaning":"没能","explanation":"못하다：没能；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26838","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못해요","audio":"/audio/90aab492af74192aeeba.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71215","definition":"用于指示与话者、听者离得很远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"c4df0bdce9d53b7c","term":"선수","zh":"选手，运动员","audio":"/audio/c4df0bdce9d53b7cc97a.mp3","entryId":"62050","definition":"体育比赛中被选为代表的人；或指以运动为职业的人。","pronunciation":["선ː수"]},{"id":"99639e469007f578","term":"훈련","zh":"训练","audio":"/audio/99639e469007f57866a7.mp3","entryId":"87055","definition":"重复练习基本姿势或动作等。","pronunciation":["훌ː련"]},{"id":"2f64811b687303a9","term":"오래","zh":"好久，很久","audio":"/audio/2f64811b687303a9be76.mp3","entryId":"57308","definition":"长时间。","pronunciation":["오래"]},{"id":"2944aeb3d3cc8afc","term":"버티다","zh":"坚持，挺住","audio":"/audio/2944aeb3d3cc8afc54b4.mp3","entryId":"14497","definition":"长时间忍耐撑住。","pronunciation":["버티다"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"没能","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"26838","definition":"表示之前的话所指的行动未能达成或没有做该事的能力。","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/406fbd033a8e523f64f8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91676-1-8-2","ko":"지구력이 부족해서 그런 것 같군요.","zh":"看来是因为耐力不足吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지구력이","meaning":"持久力，耐力","explanation":"지구력：持久力，耐力；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지구력","audio":"/audio/ef37ba7c7a6789c70f3e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91676","senseId":"1","lemma":"지구력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지구력이","audio":"/audio/43c08a69d5e5bca9ac2d.mp3"}},{"text":"부족해서","meaning":"不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺","explanation":"부족하다：不足，缺乏，不够，欠缺；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"부족하다","audio":"/audio/3dd9c5f65c6da41a8a1c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59849","senseId":"1","lemma":"부족하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부족해서","audio":"/audio/3c5164642e5d40f5f97b.mp3"}},{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样。","r